		{
			dependencies: [ ]
			description: [
				"Every village is a ruin, each its own age: roofs caved in, walls crumbled, timber rotted, rubble where it fell, and nature moving back in. Nobody lives there, not even golems."
				""
				"Salvage what's left: cold campfires, lanterns, beds, workstations and the odd Cold Furnace. Someone got to the chests first and took anything valuable. Mind the rotted floors: land on them hard and they can give way."
				""
				"After dark the old locals turn up again, as zombie villagers, wherever it's dark enough."
			]
			id: "61E8ED08B9F21D4D"
			rewards: [ ]
			subtitle: "Long abandoned"
			tasks: [
